WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.600
Thank you for being here.

00:03.600 --> 00:08.600
It is very important to me that you are here.
Each one of you means so much to me.

00:08.600 --> 00:14.200
So let's take the photo.
Let's go! Let's do it!

00:14.200 --> 00:22.600
So cheerful, so happy,
so proud to be with these children,

00:22.600 --> 00:25.800
to see them having such a good time
and supporting one another.

00:25.800 --> 00:31.200
Another incredibly special, magical day
with the children of Caminos Nativos,

00:31.200 --> 00:35.000
of Pedalea con Conciencia,
here in Cabrera.

00:35.000 --> 00:41.800
This day is especially important because
we had the pleasure of welcoming

00:41.800 --> 00:45.400
Julio Jaramillo
and his wonderful family.

00:45.400 --> 00:52.000
It is incredible to see our children after
four years of running this program,

00:52.000 --> 00:57.400
and to see how much they have grown,
how connected they are, how fully themselves.

00:57.400 --> 01:01.000
I hope to keep coming to Cabrera
for many years to come.

01:01.000 --> 01:39.600
[Music]

01:39.600 --> 01:47.600
Today has been a magical day.
It has been one of our happiest days,

01:47.600 --> 01:54.800
and the joy comes from seeing children
showing their talent.

01:54.800 --> 02:00.600
Truly, thank you so much to everyone
who has joined this dream,

02:00.600 --> 02:06.200
who has joined this community,
this community of believing and fulfilling dreams.

02:06.200 --> 02:11.000
We are beginning the fourth phase
of the Pedalea con Conciencia project,

02:11.000 --> 02:16.400
of Fundación Caminos Nativos,
with [inaudible], sponsors who are visiting us.

02:16.400 --> 02:21.000
We thank you. We are happy.
We are very fortunate to have you here today

02:21.000 --> 02:26.000
and to see how these young people are benefiting
from this wonderful project.

02:26.000 --> 02:34.390
[Music]
